{"resource":{"id":"go-tips-and-tricks","title":"Go — Tips & Tricks","category":"Programming","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"10 min","pages":9,"lastUpdated":"September 2026","tags":["Programming","Go","Concurrency"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461749280684-dccba630e2f6?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"150+ productivity tips, debugging tricks, performance hacks, and interview strategies for Go developers."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"s1","label":"1. Productivity Hacks"},{"id":"s2","label":"2. Debugging Tricks"},{"id":"s3","label":"3. Editor Shortcuts"},{"id":"s4","label":"4. Performance Tricks"},{"id":"s5","label":"5. Concurrency Tips"},{"id":"s6","label":"6. Testing Tips"},{"id":"s7","label":"7. Interview Advice"},{"id":"s8","label":"8. Engineering Habits"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"glossary","label":"Glossary"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"Go — Common Mistakes","tag":"Programming","time":"13 min"},{"title":"Go — Best Practices","tag":"Programming","time":"17 min"},{"title":"Go — Cheat Sheet","tag":"Programming","time":"9 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Move faster with editor, CLI, and workflow shortcuts.</li>\n          <li>Ship cleaner code with battle-tested tricks.</li>\n          <li>Ace interviews with concrete talking points.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s1\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">1. Productivity Hacks</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <Tip><code>go run .</code> beats compiling for scratch scripts.</Tip>\n          <Tip><code>go doc pkg.Func</code> in the terminal — no browser needed.</Tip>\n          <Tip>Alias <code>gt=\"go test ./... -race\"</code>.</Tip>\n          <Tip>Use <code>air</code> for hot reload during API dev.</Tip>\n          <Tip>Learn <code>errgroup</code>; it replaces a lot of boilerplate.</Tip>\n        </ul>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 — Editor + CLI workflow: fast feedback loop is the whole game.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s2\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">2. Debugging Tricks</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <Tip><code>go test -run TestFoo -v</code> to isolate one test.</Tip>\n          <Tip><code>GOFLAGS=\"-race\" go test ./...</code>.</Tip>\n          <Tip>Import <code>net/http/pprof</code> for live profiling.</Tip>\n          <Tip><code>dlv debug</code> for step-through debugging.</Tip>\n          <Tip><code>runtime.Stack</code> to dump goroutines on demand.</Tip>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s3\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">3. Editor Shortcuts (VS Code)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <Tip><code>F12</code> — go to definition.</Tip>\n          <Tip><code>Shift+F12</code> — find references.</Tip>\n          <Tip><code>Ctrl+Shift+O</code> — jump to symbol.</Tip>\n          <Tip><code>gopls</code> code actions: extract func, inline var.</Tip>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s4\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">4. Performance Tricks</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <Tip>Preallocate slices: <code>make([]T, 0, n)</code>.</Tip>\n          <Tip><code>strings.Builder</code> for concatenation in loops.</Tip>\n          <Tip><code>sync.Pool</code> for hot-path buffers.</Tip>\n          <Tip>Avoid interfaces on inner loops when concrete types work.</Tip>\n          <Tip>Benchmark before optimizing: <code>go test -bench=.</code>.</Tip>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>var bufPool = sync.Pool{New: func() any { return new(bytes.Buffer) }}\nb := bufPool.Get().(*bytes.Buffer)\nb.Reset()\ndefer bufPool.Put(b)</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s5\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">5. Concurrency Tips</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <Tip>Pass <code>context.Context</code> as the first parameter — always.</Tip>\n          <Tip>Cap fan-out with <code>errgroup.SetLimit(n)</code>.</Tip>\n          <Tip>Close channels from the sender, never the receiver.</Tip>\n          <Tip>Use <code>select</code> with <code>ctx.Done()</code> for cancellable waits.</Tip>\n        </ul>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544197150-b99a580bb7a8?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 — Concurrency pattern: bounded fan-out, single sender closes the channel, receivers drain.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s6\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">6. Testing Tips</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <Tip>Table-driven tests scale better than inline cases.</Tip>\n          <Tip><code>t.Parallel()</code> — but only with subtests.</Tip>\n          <Tip>Golden files for snapshot tests.</Tip>\n          <Tip><code>testcontainers-go</code> for real Postgres/Redis in tests.</Tip>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s7\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">7. Interview Advice</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <Tip>Explain the GMP scheduler with a whiteboard sketch.</Tip>\n          <Tip>Know when a slice header is copied vs. the backing array.</Tip>\n          <Tip>Have a war story: one race condition you fixed.</Tip>\n          <Tip>Ask about their observability stack — shows seniority.</Tip>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-sky-500/40 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-900 dark:text-sky-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"/><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Interviewer favourite</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">\"Walk me through what happens when I call <code>go f()</code>.\"</div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s8\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">8. Engineering Habits</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <Tip>Small PRs (&lt; 300 LOC) get merged 3× faster.</Tip>\n          <Tip>Write the test first when fixing a bug.</Tip>\n          <Tip>ADRs for anything you'll forget in 6 months.</Tip>\n          <Tip>Read one Go proposal per week — trains architectural taste.</Tip>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Tips compound. Adopt three per week; in a year you'll be measurably faster than the version of you reading this now.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Any AI tools worth it?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Copilot / Cursor for boilerplate; verify with <code>go vet</code> and tests.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>How do I stay current?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">The Go Blog, Changelog, and one podcast (Go Time).</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"glossary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Glossary</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>gopls</strong> — Go language server for editors.</li>\n          <li><strong>ADR</strong> — Architecture Decision Record.</li>\n          <li><strong>errgroup</strong> — coordinated goroutines with error propagation.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Tips are heuristics — measure impact in your context.</p>\n      </div></section>"}